Doctor accessing patient record:
http://127.0.0.1:5000/get_patient_record?username=doc1

Admin accessing manage users:
http://127.0.0.1:5000/manage_users?username=admin1

Patient accessing own data:
http://127.0.0.1:5000/read_own_data?username=patient1

Patient trying to read patient records (not allowed):
http://127.0.0.1:5000/get_patient_record?username=patient1
If you try this 3 times, the system will block the user:


